## Summary
Starting from September, the notification service for elementary school students' arrival and departure in Seoul will be provided completely free of charge. This service aims to enhance child safety by alerting parents or guardians about students' commute status, potentially reducing risks associated with school travel.

## Key Points
- The notification service is exclusively for elementary school students in Seoul.
- It focuses on real-time alerts for arrival and departure at school.
- The service will be entirely free for all users beginning in September.
- It is likely implemented to improve child safety and parental awareness.
- The initiative may be supported by local government or educational authorities.


